# purpose: all ten commands over ~150 lines, with SUMMARY windows that straddle transfers and
#          freeze/unfreeze pairs, and HISTORY on accounts with long and short pasts.
# exercises: everything; in particular SUMMARY closing must agree with the running balance at
#            every window edge, and count must include OPENED/FROZEN/UNFROZEN/CLOSED facts.

OPEN p1 USD
OPEN p2 USD
OPEN p3 USD
OPEN q1 GBP
OPEN q2 GBP

DEPOSIT p1 400
DEPOSIT p2 400
DEPOSIT p3 400
DEPOSIT q1 80
DEPOSIT q2 20

# round 1
TRANSFER p2 p3 3
TRANSFER p3 p1 150
TRANSFER p1 p2 1.25
DEPOSIT p2 0.5
TRANSFER q2 q1 1.25
BALANCE p2

# round 2
TRANSFER p3 p1 40
TRANSFER p1 p2 8.08
TRANSFER p2 p3 12
WITHDRAW p3 99.99
TRANSFER q1 q2 99.99
FREEZE p2
TRANSFER p1 p2 1
DEPOSIT p2 1
BALANCE p3

# round 3
TRANSFER p1 p2 0.5
TRANSFER p2 p3 99.99
TRANSFER p3 p1 3
DEPOSIT p1 3
TRANSFER q2 q1 8.08
UNFREEZE p2
BALANCE p1

# round 4
TRANSFER p2 p3 150
TRANSFER p3 p1 1.25
TRANSFER p1 p2 40
WITHDRAW p2 150
TRANSFER q1 q2 150
TRANSFER q1 p1 1
SUMMARY q1 1 200
HISTORY q2
BALANCE p2

# round 5
TRANSFER p3 p1 8.08
TRANSFER p1 p2 12
TRANSFER p2 p3 0.5
DEPOSIT p3 1.25
TRANSFER q2 q1 0.5
WITHDRAW q2 1000
SUMMARY p2 10 20
SUMMARY p2 20 30
BALANCE p3

# round 6
TRANSFER p1 p2 99.99
TRANSFER p2 p3 3
TRANSFER p3 p1 150
WITHDRAW p1 40
TRANSFER q1 q2 40
SUMMARY p1 1 1
SUMMARY p1 2 2
SUMMARY p1 36 37
SUMMARY p3 37 38
BALANCE p1

# round 7
TRANSFER p2 p3 1.25
TRANSFER p3 p1 40
TRANSFER p1 p2 8.08
DEPOSIT p2 8.08
TRANSFER q2 q1 3
HISTORY p1
SUMMARY p1 0 1000
BALANCE p2

# round 8
TRANSFER p3 p1 12
TRANSFER p1 p2 0.5
TRANSFER p2 p3 99.99
WITHDRAW p3 12
TRANSFER q1 q2 12
BALANCE p3

# q2 drains and closes; queries on it are then refused, but its facts still count in others' windows
BALANCE q2
HISTORY q2
SUMMARY q2 1 50
WITHDRAW q2 6.75
BALANCE q2
CLOSE q2
HISTORY q2
SUMMARY q2 1 60
SUMMARY q1 1 60
SUMMARY q1 50 60

# windows on every account, edges chosen to fall inside transfers
SUMMARY p1 12 13
SUMMARY p2 12 13
SUMMARY p3 12 13
SUMMARY p1 13 14
SUMMARY p2 13 14
SUMMARY p1 1 30
SUMMARY p2 1 30
SUMMARY p3 1 30
SUMMARY p1 31 60
SUMMARY p2 31 60
SUMMARY p3 31 60
HISTORY p2
HISTORY p3
HISTORY q1

BALANCE p1
BALANCE p2
BALANCE p3
BALANCE q1
